真功能的多功能印表機可以"}],"themes":[{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":4},{"name":"分析師評等","count":4},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"能源/電力","count":1},{"name":"財報","count":1},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-08-05","period":"2026-06-30","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/8670/000000867026000030/adp-20260630.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"In 1949, our founders established ADP with a simple, innovative idea: help clients focus on their business by solving their payroll challenges. In the 77 years since, we have led the Human Capital Management (\"HCM\") industry in innovation. We were the first in HCM to deliver automation, move to the cloud, provide a mobile app, and create an online marketplace. Today, we continue that legacy with artificial intelligence (\"AI\"), building AI into the very core of how we orchestrate, govern and execute HR and pay processes for real-world outcomes.","zh":null},{"en":"As AI adds new layers of complexity to managing the workforce infrastructure that makes business possible, our clients need a partner they can trust. As the trusted, service-driven, and AI-enabled partner for HCM, we deliver services powered by deep domain expertise, workforce data, and global scale to help organizations manage their most critical workforce functions with precision, compliance and confidence. Today, we are a global leader in HR and payroll solutions, serving over 1.1 million clients and paying over 42 million workers in over 140 countries and territories. Our common stock is listed on the NASDAQ Global Select Market under the symbol \"ADP.\"","zh":null},{"en":"When we refer to \"we,\" \"us,\" \"our,\" \"ADP,\" or the \"Company\" in this Annual Report on Form 10-K, we mean Automatic Data Processing, Inc. and its consolidated subsidiaries.","zh":null}],"markets":[{"en":"To help clients manage the workforce infrastructure that makes business possible, whether they're a Fortune 500 company or a small local business, we provide a unified ecosystem of HCM solutions rooted in our industry-leading data and deep domain expertise. Our strategic cloud-based platforms, scalable by company size and location, allow clients to recruit, onboard, pay, manage and retain their people in one single space with precision, compliance and confidence. Our AI is built into the very core of how our platforms orchestrate, govern and execute HR and pay processes for real-world outcomes.","zh":null},{"en":"Integrated HCM Solutions. Our premier suite of HCM solutions support employers of all types and sizes across the entire employment cycle, from recruitment to retirement.","zh":null}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The industries in which we operate are highly competitive and we are one of the largest providers of HCM solutions in the world. HCM Solutions, Global Solutions and HRO Solutions (other than PEO) compete with other business outsourcing companies, companies providing ERP services, providers of cloud-based HCM solutions and financial institutions. Our PEO business competes with other PEOs providing similar services, as well as business outsourcing companies, companies providing ERP services and providers of cloud-based HCM solutions. We also face ongoing competition from companies' in-house functions, whereby companies install and operate their own HCM system.","zh":null},{"en":"Competition for business outsourcing solutions is primarily based on product and service quality, reputation, ease of use and accessibility of technology, breadth of offerings, and price. We believe that we are competitive in each of these areas and that our leading-edge technology (together with our data) and commitment to service excellence, distinguishes us from our competitors.","zh":null}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-06-30","items":[{"name":"Employer Services","val":14831400000,"zh":"Employer Services"},{"name":"Professional Employee Organization Services","val":7128100000,"zh":"Professional Employee Organization Services"}],"total":21947400000},"prod":{"end":"2026-06-30","items":[{"name":"Revenues Other Than Interest On Funds Held For Client","val":20592600000,"zh":"Revenues Other Than Interest On Funds Held For Client"},{"name":"Revenues Other Than Interest On Funds Held For Clients & PEO Revenues","val":13476800000,"zh":"Revenues Other Than Interest On Funds Held For Clients & PEO Revenues"},{"name":"HCM","val":9120400000,"zh":"HCM"},{"name":"PEO Revenues","val":7115800000,"zh":"PEO Revenues"},{"name":"PEO Zero Margin Benefits Pass Throughs","val":4607300000,"zh":"PEO Zero Margin Benefits Pass Throughs"},{"name":"HRO","val":3975800000,"zh":"HRO"},{"name":"Global","val":2901200000,"zh":"Global"},{"name":"Interest On Funds Held For Clients","val":1354800000,"zh":"Interest On Funds Held For Clients"}],"total":21947400000},"geo":{"end":"2026-06-30","items":[{"name":"US","val":19279800000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":1733300000,"zh":"EMEA"},{"name":"CA","val":523700000.00000006,"zh":"加拿大"},{"name":"Other Geographical Places","val":410600000,"zh":"Other Geographical Places"}],"total":21947400000}},"peers":["PAYX","ITW","APD","EMR","AFL"]}}